      "question": "How do we ensure that the prices and specific deployment guarantees are in the records?",
      "reply": "Choose Contribute product knowledge to explain the details and their scope. Then open Knowledge review, check the wording, save the proposed claim, and enable it for internal rehearsal after review. That does not itself establish a customer guarantee.",
