      "question": "Okay, so can you tell me what is Ops Atlas used for?",
      "reply": "OpsAtlas helps organizations manage their knowledge and operations by combining document retrieval with structured insights. It provides cited answers, process intelligence, governance workflows, and analytics to track activities and risks.",
