      "question": "Can you tell me a little bit more about the product?",
      "reply": "OpsAtlas is a local-first platform that combines document retrieval with structured knowledge to give you cited answers and process intelligence. It includes features like a Process Registry, diagrams, and views on accountability and risk based on governed evidence.",
